{"new_posts":[{"id":"new-01","kind":"file","slot":1,"format":"single","title":"single — Cocoon Armchair (p.13)","caption":"Some chairs you sit on. This one holds you.\n\nThick bouclé cushions, cradled by sculptural wooden supports. The Cocoon Armchair is bold in its proportions and soft in every other way, a quiet place to sink into at the end of the day.\n\nDM us to arrange a showroom visit and sit in it yourself.\n\n#INHOUZ #FurnitureByINHOUZ #BuiltINHOUZ #CraftingInfinite #CocoonArmchair #BoucleChair #SculpturalFurniture #LuxuryFurnitureIndia #InteriorDesignIndia","is_new":true,"cover":"assets/derived/posts/post01_p013_cocoon-armchair.thumb.webp","src":"assets/derived/posts/post01_p013_cocoon-armchair.detail.webp","srcset":"assets/derived/posts/post01_p013_cocoon-armchair.thumb.webp 400w, assets/derived/posts/post01_p013_cocoon-armchair.detail.webp 1080w","width":400,"height":400,"detail_width":1080,"detail_height":1350,"slides":[{"src":"assets/derived/posts/post01_p013_cocoon-armchair.detail.webp","srcset":"assets/derived/posts/post01_p013_cocoon-armchair.thumb.webp 400w, assets/derived/posts/post01_p013_cocoon-armchair.detail.webp 1080w","detail_width":1080,"detail_height":1350}]},{"id":"new-02","kind":"file","slot":2,"format":"carousel","title":"carousel — Pumpkin family (p.150, p.23, p.196)","caption":"One shape. Three scales.\n\nIt starts with the pouff: a bulbous silhouette with deep vertical channelling, raised on teardrop-shaped feet. Swipe and the shape grows into the armchair, then the Pumpkin Sofa, with plush fabric seating, tufted detailing and sleek metal legs.\n\nPouff, armchair or sofa: where would you start?\n\n#INHOUZ #FurnitureByINHOUZ #BuiltINHOUZ #CraftingInfinite #PumpkinSofa #DesignerSofa #LivingRoomDesign #LuxuryFurnitureIndia #LuxuryInteriors #ContemporaryFurniture","is_new":true,"is_carousel":true,"cover":"assets/derived/posts/post02_p196_pumpkin-pouff.thumb.webp","src":"assets/derived/posts/post02_p196_pumpkin-pouff.detail.webp","srcset"