ereArmchair #CarvedWood #IndianDesign #CraftedInIndia #CollectibleDesign","is_new":true,"cover":"assets/derived/posts/post03_p014_cashmere-armchair.thumb.webp","src":"assets/derived/posts/post03_p014_cashmere-armchair.detail.webp","srcset":"assets/derived/posts/post03_p014_cashmere-armchair.thumb.webp 400w, assets/derived/posts/post03_p014_cashmere-armchair.detail.webp 1080w","width":400,"height":400,"detail_width":1080,"detail_height":1350,"slides":[{"src":"assets/derived/posts/post03_p014_cashmere-armchair.detail.webp","srcset":"assets/derived/posts/post03_p014_cashmere-armchair.thumb.webp 400w, assets/derived/posts/post03_p014_cashmere-armchair.detail.webp 1080w","detail_width":1080,"detail_height":1350}]},{"id":"new-04","kind":"file","slot":4,"format":"single","title":"single — Drape Dining Table (p.107)","caption":"It looks like fabric. It's metal.\n\nThe base of the Drape Dining Table falls in folds, like a curtain caught mid-movement. It has the softness of drapery with the strength of metal, at a generous 2700 mm long.\n\nDM us to see the Drape base up close, or book a showroom visit.\n\n#INHOUZ #FurnitureByINHOUZ #BuiltINHOUZ #CraftingInfinite #DrapeDiningTable #DiningTableDesign #SculpturalFurniture #StatementFurniture #LuxuryInteriors #LuxuryFurnitureIndia","is_new":true,"cover":"assets/derived/posts/post04_p107_drape-dining-table.thumb.webp","src":"assets/derived/posts/post04_p107_drape-dining-table.detail.webp","srcset":"assets/derived/posts/post04_p107_drape-dining-table.thumb.webp 400w, assets/derived/posts/post04_p107_drape-dining-table.detail.webp 1080w","width":400,"height":400,"detail_width":1080,"detail_height":1350,"slides":[{"src":"assets/derived/posts/post04_p107_drape-dining-table.detail.webp","srcset":"assets/derived/posts/post04_p107_drape-dining-table.thumb.webp 400w, assets/derived/posts/post04_p107_drape-dining-table.detail.webp 1080w","detail_width":1080,"detail_height":1350}]},{"id":"new-05","kind":"file","slot":5,"format":"single","title":"single, grid centre — Agni Conference (p.201)","caption":"Inspired by the Hawan Kund.\n\nThe Agni Conference Table takes the sacred geometry of the Hawan Kund and turns it into an inverted pyramid in a sleek black finish. It's a centrepiece built for focus, with a ceremonial presence at the head of the room.\n\nFor workspaces and boardrooms, DM us to start a conversation.\n\n#INHOUZ #FurnitureByINHOUZ #BuiltINHOUZ #CraftingInfinite #SacredGeometry #AgniTable #ConferenceTable #OfficeInteriors #IndianDesign #MadeInIndia","is_new":true,"cover":"assets/derived/posts/post05_p201_agni-conference.thumb.webp","src":"assets/derived/posts/post05_p201_agni-conference.detail.webp","srcset":"assets/derived/posts/post05_p201_agni-conference.thumb.webp 400w, assets/derived/posts/post05_p201_agni-conference.detail.webp 1080w","width":400,"height":400,"detail_width":1080,"detail_height":1350,"slides":[{"src":"assets/derived/posts/post05_p201_agni-conference.detail.webp","srcset":"assets/derived/posts/post05_p201_agni-conference.thumb.webp 400w, assets/derived/posts/post05_p201_agni-conference.detail.webp 1080w","detail_width":1080,"detail_height":1350}]},{"id":"new-06","kind":"file","slot":6,"format":"carousel","title":"carousel — Rani family (p.103, p.186, p.161)","caption":"Every room needs a queen.\n\nThe Rani family takes its cue from the queen on a chessboard. The console pairs a rich marble top with wooden legs and metal details. The sideboard hides fabric-lined cabinets behind lacquer and a warm LED glow. The side table rests a pebble-shaped wooden top on a four-pronged metallic base.\n\nConsole, sideboard or side table: which would you crown first?\nDM us to see the Rani set in person.\n\n#INHOUZ #FurnitureByINHOUZ #BuiltINHOUZ #CraftingInfinite #RaniCollection #MarbleConsole #StatementFurniture #LuxuryFurnitureIndia #InteriorDesignIndia #LuxuryInteriors","is_new":true,"is_carousel":true,"cover":"assets/derived/posts/post06_p103_rani-console.thumb.webp","src":"assets/d